        "raw_output": "```json\n{\n  \"slots\": [\n    {\n      \"variable\": \"podcast_history\",\n      \"observations\": [\n        {\n          \"id\": \"fact_a67046ca6c35ba8f869fdb3b\",\n          \"stance\": \"support\",\n          \"value\": \"The user started a podcast about music trends in 2018, but found it too time-consuming and overwhelming. The responsibilities of researching, recording, editing, scheduling interviews, show notes, and social media promotion caused their passion to wane. They paused the podcast because it felt like a chore rather than a passion, and they wanted to enjoy music rather than structure it into segments. In 2020, they tried podcasting about historical music trends but found it tedious and uninspiring due to the overwhelming amount of research. They lost interest and felt it took away the joy of music. Later, they launched a podcast discussing the fusion of traditional and electronic music, which they found invigorating and authentic. They enjoyed interviewing artists, sharing experiences, receiving positive feedback, and connecting with others. This reignited their creativity and passion for music.\",\n          \"source_ids\": [\"s16\", \"s17\", \"s5\", \"s6\", \"s37\", \"s28\", \"s27\", \"s35\", \"s7\", \"s36\", \"s4\", \"s34\", \"s15\", \"s3\"],\n          \"entity_scope\": \"user\",\n          \"time_scope\": \"past\",\n          \"parent_versions\": {},\n          \"retract_ids\": [],\n          \"reason\": \"The user's own statements across multiple conversations describe starting a music trends podcast in 2018 (s3), finding it overwhelming and pausing it (s4-s7), trying a historical music trends podcast in 2020 and finding it tedious (s15-s17), losing interest in a music theory podcast (s27-s28), and later launching a fusion traditional/electronic music podcast that they found positive and invigorating (s34-s37). These are all user statements with source_role 'user'.\"\n        }\n      ],\n      \"unresolved\": []\n   